WEBVTT

00:12.030 --> 00:13.570
<b>You're finally up.</b>

00:14.700 --> 00:15.990
<b>Sorey!</b>

00:15.990 --> 00:17.330
<b>How do you feel?</b>

00:17.780 --> 00:20.330
<b>Mikleo, Lailah...</b>

00:20.540 --> 00:23.330
<b>You've been out with a high fever for three days, you know.</b>

00:23.330 --> 00:24.920
<b>Three days?</b>

00:24.920 --> 00:28.960
<b>It's probably because you became my vessel.</b>

00:28.960 --> 00:32.220
<b>Who knows what would've happened if Alisha didn't save you?</b>

00:32.550 --> 00:33.680
<b>Alisha?</b>

00:34.590 --> 00:36.220
<b>That's right! Where's Alisha?!</b>

00:41.140 --> 00:42.230
<b>Sorey!</b>

00:42.640 --> 00:43.810
<b>Alisha!</b>

00:45.270 --> 00:47.020
<b>Thank goodness!</b>

00:47.020 --> 00:48.650
<b>You're awake!</b>

00:50.230 --> 00:51.820
<b>Thanks for the food!</b>

00:52.240 --> 00:56.660
<b>Given your appetite, I guess the worst must be over.</b>

00:56.660 --> 00:59.330
<b>Yeah! The food was great!</b>

00:59.870 --> 01:03.000
<b>Alisha, you took care of me this whole time, right?</b>

01:03.000 --> 01:04.120
<b>Thank you.</b>

01:06.170 --> 01:08.880
<b>I should be the one thanking you.</b>

01:09.130 --> 01:15.880
<b>When you drew the Sacred Blade and quelled the riot at the festival,</b>

01:15.880 --> 01:19.390
<b>my heart raced like never before.</b>

01:19.640 --> 01:23.470
<b>I felt an overwhelming sense of gratitude.</b>

01:24.310 --> 01:25.730
<b>Does that sound strange to you?</b>

01:26.350 --> 01:27.560
<b>Not really...</b>

01:28.810 --> 01:33.360
<b>To show my gratitude, I'd like to give you something.</b>

01:37.110 --> 01:38.320
<b>Sorey!</b>

01:42.990 --> 01:43.040
{OP}

01:59.930 --> 02:06.680
haruka sono saki eto kimi no michi o

01:59.930 --> 02:06.680
We'll ride upon the wind to follow

02:06.680 --> 02:09.230
oikaze ni noteyukou

02:06.680 --> 02:09.230
Your path leading far off into the distance

02:09.980 --> 02:16.570
sagasu kotae tayasuku mitsukari wa shinai

02:09.980 --> 02:16.570
The answers we seek won't be easy to find

02:16.740 --> 02:21.120
hajime kara wakattete fumidashitanda

02:16.740 --> 02:21.120
We set out knowing that from the start

02:22.410 --> 02:30.580
nandomo toomawari shite yume no ashiato

02:22.410 --> 02:30.580
We wander endlessly to leave behind records of our dream

02:30.580 --> 02:35.050
kachikan tte itta sekai chizu o hirogetara

02:30.580 --> 02:35.050
It's worth it if it widens our map of the world

02:35.880 --> 02:40.430
hibike kaze no uta me o togireba

02:35.880 --> 02:40.430
Resound, oh song of the wind

02:40.430 --> 02:43.760
kokoro no koe senaka osu yo

02:40.430 --> 02:43.760
Should we forgo sight, the voices of our hearts will push us forwards

02:43.760 --> 02:49.140
mezasu nowa zutto motto takaku

02:43.760 --> 02:49.140
We always aim ever higher

02:49.520 --> 02:53.900
todoke kaze no uta mimi sumaseba

02:49.520 --> 02:53.900
Carry on, oh song of the wind

02:53.900 --> 02:57.320
kokoro no koe afuredasu yo

02:53.900 --> 02:57.320
Should we go without hearing, the voices of our hearts will gush forth

02:57.320 --> 03:02.530
mabayui hodo no kagayaki o hanatsu

02:57.320 --> 03:02.530
Emitting a dazzling radiance

03:02.530 --> 03:06.200
kimi yo aoi senritsu ni nare

03:02.530 --> 03:06.200
Your azure melody rings true

03:12.960 --> 03:12.960
<b>{Part A}</b>

03:13.460 --> 03:16.210
<b>The Shepherd's garb looks wonderful on you.</b>

03:16.670 --> 03:20.010
<b>Yes, you wear it well.</b>

03:20.010 --> 03:21.760
<b>So you <i>can</i> put lipstick on a pig.</b>

03:22.010 --> 03:24.640
<b>Just admit it, Mikleo. You're jealous.</b>

03:24.640 --> 03:26.640
<b>Yeah, you wish.</b>

03:28.140 --> 03:31.270
<b>I take it there's a seraph present with you?</b>

03:31.270 --> 03:32.810
<b>That's right.</b>

03:32.810 --> 03:34.560
<b>His name is Mikleo.</b>

03:39.190 --> 03:40.320
<b>Sorey!</b>

03:40.320 --> 03:43.160
<b>And this here is Lailah.</b>

03:43.160 --> 03:46.080
<b>She's the one everyone calls the Lady of the Lake.</b>

03:48.450 --> 03:52.580
<b>I truly believe in my heart that you were meant to become the Shepherd.</b>

03:53.620 --> 03:59.630
<b>Whereas the rest of us here in the city can be standing right next to seraphim and still not notice.</b>

03:59.630 --> 04:01.550
<b>That's not quite true.</b>

04:01.550 --> 04:03.130
<b>She can't hear you.</b>

04:05.260 --> 04:09.100
<b>Sorey, try taking Alisha's hand in your own.</b>

04:10.220 --> 04:14.940
<b>We might be able to communicate to her through you.</b>

04:16.360 --> 04:17.440
<b>Alisha!</b>

04:23.530 --> 04:24.910
<b>Like this?</b>

04:29.450 --> 04:32.120
<b>Can you hear me, Alisha?</b>

04:32.120 --> 04:33.120
<b>It's Lailah.</b>

04:36.500 --> 04:39.250
<b>I don't think she heard you.</b>

04:44.130 --> 04:46.720
<b>Okay, then. Sorey, try closing your eyes.</b>

04:46.720 --> 04:47.600
<b>Close my eyes?</b>

04:49.510 --> 04:53.480
<b>Testing, testing. Can you hear me now?</b>

04:55.520 --> 04:56.980
<b>Still no good.</b>

04:57.360 --> 05:00.360
<b>Maybe Sorey isn't concentrating hard enough.</b>

05:00.360 --> 05:01.820
<b>So it's my fault?</b>

05:02.110 --> 05:04.950
<b>Sorey! Keep your eyes closed!</b>

05:04.950 --> 05:07.820
<b>And this time, hold your breath.</b>

05:07.820 --> 05:08.820
<b>What?!</b>

05:09.330 --> 05:10.910
<b>Sorey?</b>

05:10.910 --> 05:12.910
<b>Oh, sorry, we're just troubleshooting.</b>

05:20.380 --> 05:21.840
<b>Alisha!</b>

05:23.090 --> 05:25.760
<b>I can hear it! Another woman's voice!</b>

05:26.380 --> 05:27.590
<b>Really?!</b>

05:28.050 --> 05:30.430
<b>Was that Mikleo just now?</b>

05:30.430 --> 05:32.350
<b>Y-Yeah...</b>

05:33.220 --> 05:37.690
<b>Please, find it in your grace to forgive my rudeness up until now, Seraph Mikleo.</b>

05:37.690 --> 05:40.940
<b>Rudeness? You've never struck me as rude.</b>

05:42.070 --> 05:43.530
<b>Alisha...</b>

05:43.530 --> 05:47.860
<b>We seraphim are able to see right into the very hearts of humans.</b>

05:48.200 --> 05:52.030
<b>No matter the circumstances, never neglect the seraphim.</b>

05:52.030 --> 05:55.830
<b>Or your heart shall turn to malevolence, and this in turn shall bring calamity.</b>

05:59.380 --> 06:01.250
<b>Fear not, Alisha.</b>

06:01.250 --> 06:03.050
<b>We've seen your gratitude for ourselves.</b>

06:06.970 --> 06:09.390
<b>Sorey, one more time!</b>

06:09.390 --> 06:12.050
<b>Isn't there a better way to do this?</b>

06:12.310 --> 06:16.100
<b>Once you've grown more accustomed to my power and gained more experience as a Shepherd,</b>

06:16.100 --> 06:19.600
<b>I believe such a strict sensory block will not be required.</b>

06:20.190 --> 06:25.320
<b>Does that mean once I grow stronger as a Shepherd, 
everyone'll be able to hear the seraphim?</b>

06:25.690 --> 06:26.900
<b>Everyone?</b>

06:29.740 --> 06:34.160
<b>As for Alisha, she most likely has had high resonance from birth.</b>

06:34.620 --> 06:35.870
<b>I see.</b>

06:36.410 --> 06:38.660
<b>Looks like it's not that simple.</b>

06:39.580 --> 06:42.670
<b>Regardless, I was able to have a conversation with her.</b>

06:42.670 --> 06:46.840
<b>I now have no doubts that the seraphim do indeed live among us.</b>

06:46.840 --> 06:48.090
<b>And that alone...</b>

06:48.090 --> 06:49.760
<b>Gets your heart racing?</b>

06:49.760 --> 06:50.970
<b>Yes!</b>

06:53.300 --> 06:54.350
<b>Pardon me.</b>

06:55.640 --> 06:57.980
<b>Princess Alisha, it's almost time.</b>

06:58.350 --> 07:00.690
<b>Okay, I'll be right there.</b>

07:00.690 --> 07:05.520
<b>My apologies. I must leave for the palace.</b>

07:05.520 --> 07:06.440
<b>Oh, okay.</b>

07:07.030 --> 07:11.200
<b>Sorey, why don't we go into town too?</b>

07:18.910 --> 07:20.210
<b>Are those...</b>

07:27.090 --> 07:30.130
<b>When word got out of the appearance of the Shepherd,</b>

07:30.130 --> 07:33.300
<b>the citizens began putting up banners with the mark of the Shepherd.</b>

07:33.640 --> 07:38.810
<b>I suppose that deep down, they, too, 
were waiting for the Shepherd to come.</b>

07:44.150 --> 07:46.150
<b>What's wrong?</b>

07:46.480 --> 07:48.150
<b>No, it's just...</b>

07:48.150 --> 07:51.860
<b>When you put it that way, 
it makes me a little nervous.</b>

07:51.860 --> 07:53.110
<b>Oh?</b>

07:53.110 --> 07:56.330
<b>You're actually capable of getting nervous?</b>

07:56.330 --> 07:57.280
<b>I guess so.</b>

08:02.580 --> 08:05.170
<b>Thanks for the ride, Alisha.</b>

08:05.420 --> 08:07.130
<b>You're welcome.</b>

08:07.130 --> 08:08.500
<b>Well, I'll see you later.</b>

08:14.010 --> 08:15.430
<b>Shall we go, then?</b>

08:19.020 --> 08:20.060
<b>Sorey!</b>

08:21.640 --> 08:26.060
<b>I feel a little nauseated.</b>

08:26.360 --> 08:29.320
<b>Were you lying earlier when you said you felt better?</b>

08:29.320 --> 08:32.280
<b>I really did feel better in the morning.</b>

08:32.280 --> 08:34.950
<b>But as we got closer to town, it slowly got worse.</b>

08:35.820 --> 08:39.160
<b>What you're feeling is the malevolence all around us.</b>

08:39.160 --> 08:40.450
<b>This...</b>

08:41.450 --> 08:42.500
<b>is malevolence?</b>

08:47.130 --> 08:51.170
<b>But it feels like a separate malevolence is mixed in.</b>

08:51.170 --> 08:52.800
<b>Where is it coming from?</b>

08:53.550 --> 08:55.840
<b>I can't tell.</b>

08:56.140 --> 08:59.100
<b>You should be able to now, Sorey.</b>

08:59.470 --> 09:02.430
<b>Concentrate and try to feel it.</b>

09:16.860 --> 09:18.370
<b>It's here.</b>

09:19.830 --> 09:22.370
<b>If you feel all right...</b>

09:22.370 --> 09:24.370
<b>I'm fine now.</b>

09:24.370 --> 09:27.790
<b>I still feel a little sick, 
but it's not as bad as before.</b>

09:27.790 --> 09:31.960
<b>I want to know why the ruins here are full of malevolence.</b>

09:34.050 --> 09:35.590
<b>Your Highness...</b>

09:35.590 --> 09:41.060
<b>We ask that you hand over this so-called "Shepherd" that you are sheltering in your estate.</b>

09:41.390 --> 09:43.020
<b>Hand over?</b>

09:43.020 --> 09:44.310
<b>What do you mean?</b>

09:44.730 --> 09:46.980
<b>He has immense power.</b>

09:46.980 --> 09:51.900
<b>Do you not agree that it would be in our best interests to have him under control?</b>

09:52.610 --> 09:53.860
<b>I decline.</b>

09:55.110 --> 09:58.200
<b>You would deny the collective will of the council?</b>

09:58.700 --> 10:02.700
<b>I have no intention of handing the Shepherd over to you!</b>

10:09.380 --> 10:11.630
<b>This is definitely a door.</b>

10:11.630 --> 10:15.760
<b>But there doesn't seem to be any sort of keyhole anywhere.</b>

10:16.470 --> 10:17.680
<b>So that means...</b>

10:19.430 --> 10:21.850
<b>It's a sealed door.</b>

10:22.180 --> 10:24.850
<b>It was sealed?</b>

10:25.310 --> 10:30.690
<b>I'm guessing that whatever is beyond this door is something the citizens shouldn't see.</b>

10:30.690 --> 10:34.980
<b>If it was locked, there should be a key or something to unlock it.</b>

10:36.150 --> 10:37.490
<b>Is this it?</b>

10:44.160 --> 10:47.500
<b>You two really know a lot about ancient ruins.</b>

10:47.500 --> 10:52.330
<b>We've loved exploring ruins ever since we were kids.</b>

10:52.330 --> 10:53.630
<b>Look, Sorey!</b>

10:55.420 --> 10:57.170
<b>The crest of Hyland!</b>

10:57.590 --> 10:58.920
<b>Oh, crap!</b>

10:58.920 --> 11:00.720
<b>What is it?!</b>

11:00.720 --> 11:03.260
<b>I forgot to return this to Alisha.</b>

11:04.850 --> 11:08.600
<b>But that just might be what we need to break the seal.</b>

11:21.860 --> 11:24.070
<b>Lucky break, huh?</b>

11:25.700 --> 11:26.580
<b>Let's go!</b>

11:31.960 --> 11:32.000
<b>{Part B}</b>

11:37.000 --> 11:38.380
<b>This is impressive.</b>

11:38.380 --> 11:39.630
<b>Yeah.</b>

11:47.260 --> 11:50.100
<b>This is no ordinary malevolence.{This is... advanced malevolence.}</b>

11:55.230 --> 11:56.770
<b>That was surprising.</b>

11:56.770 --> 11:58.480
<b>It's a dragon statue.</b>

11:59.860 --> 12:01.780
<b>Aren't dragons...</b>

12:01.780 --> 12:05.280
<b>Calamity incarnate, harbingers of destruction...</b>

12:05.280 --> 12:07.830
<b>Symbols of ill fortune.</b>

12:08.330 --> 12:11.620
<b>To build a dragon statue and put it here...</b>

12:11.620 --> 12:14.290
<b>There's definitely something wrong with these ruins.</b>

12:14.540 --> 12:17.500
<b>The malevolence is much stronger here too.</b>

12:17.500 --> 12:20.380
<b>Do you think it's coming from the statue?</b>

12:20.380 --> 12:21.630
<b>No...</b>

12:21.630 --> 12:27.140
<b>The malevolence is coming from something else in here.</b>

12:28.310 --> 12:29.520
<b>Could it be...</b>

12:30.390 --> 12:31.520
<b>a hellion?</b>

12:32.810 --> 12:33.810
<b>Above us?!</b>

12:35.150 --> 12:36.810
<b>Wh-What is that?</b>

12:44.610 --> 12:45.950
<b>A bat?!</b>

12:52.370 --> 12:53.710
<b>What are they?!</b>

12:53.710 --> 12:56.420
<b>They're bats that turned into hellions.</b>

12:56.790 --> 12:58.090
<b>Sorey!</b>

12:58.090 --> 12:58.710
<b>Got it!</b>

13:05.510 --> 13:06.340
<b>I got them!</b>

13:15.890 --> 13:16.980
<b>Mikleo!</b>

13:19.900 --> 13:21.400
<b>Are you okay, Mikleo?!</b>

13:21.400 --> 13:22.650
<b>Yeah!</b>

13:22.650 --> 13:24.450
<b>There's no end to them!</b>

13:24.740 --> 13:28.410
<b>Sorey, can you disperse the hellions one more time?</b>

13:28.410 --> 13:31.290
<b>I'll purify them with my flames.</b>

13:31.290 --> 13:32.330
<b>Okay!</b>

13:39.380 --> 13:40.210
<b>Lailah!</b>

13:41.630 --> 13:45.510
<b>Crimson flames, spring forth! Dancing ember!{chant copied from game}</b>

13:45.840 --> 13:47.470
<b>Flare Vortex!{english ability name}</b>

13:56.140 --> 13:57.350
<b>You did it, Lailah!</b>

13:58.270 --> 14:01.570
<b>Sorey, how are you holding up?</b>

14:01.570 --> 14:03.440
<b>I'm fine.</b>

14:03.780 --> 14:09.620
<b>Entering into a contract with me has placed a great burden upon you.</b>

14:10.870 --> 14:16.080
<b>If you need me to lighten your burden, 
don't hesitate to ask. I can always go inside.</b>

14:16.080 --> 14:17.210
<b>Inside?</b>

14:19.080 --> 14:20.250
<b>Whoa!</b>

14:21.630 --> 14:23.380
<b>Do you see?</b>

14:23.380 --> 14:25.800
<b>This is what I mean by going inside.</b>

14:27.470 --> 14:29.890
<b>I-I get it!</b>

14:31.930 --> 14:34.680
<b>You just surprised me.</b>

14:34.680 --> 14:39.440
<b>In the future, you may enter pacts with other seraphim too.</b>

14:39.440 --> 14:42.190
<b>And in turn, they will grant you immense powers.</b>

14:42.190 --> 14:45.150
<b>But please don't forget that it'll take a toll on your body.</b>

14:45.570 --> 14:49.110
<b>When you start feeling weak, you can keep me inside.</b>

14:49.110 --> 14:51.910
<b>All right. I'll do that.</b>

14:52.370 --> 14:53.330
<b>Sorey...</b>

14:54.160 --> 14:55.490
<b>I know.</b>

14:55.490 --> 14:58.290
<b>The malevolence isn't gone from the ruins yet.</b>

15:03.340 --> 15:04.800
<b>I can feel it.</b>

15:05.090 --> 15:08.760
<b>The source of the malevolence is deeper inside.</b>

15:11.550 --> 15:12.850
<b>What is this?</b>

15:30.530 --> 15:31.780
<b>What...</b>

15:32.610 --> 15:34.030
<b>is this place?</b>

15:35.370 --> 15:36.490
<b>This is...</b>

15:38.950 --> 15:41.710
<b>the truth behind these ruins.</b>

15:42.670 --> 15:44.330
<b>Lailah?</b>

15:44.330 --> 15:47.210
<b>You know something, don't you?</b>

15:50.380 --> 15:56.680
<b>In life, they rebelled against the powers that be, and were killed here in secret.</b>

15:57.720 --> 16:02.440
<b>Their regrets and deep-seated hatred turned into malevolence.</b>

16:02.440 --> 16:06.480
<b>Though their bodies withered away, the 
malevolence lingered and gave birth to hellions.</b>

16:06.480 --> 16:09.740
<b>But why? Why here?!</b>

16:14.490 --> 16:19.490
<b>Even in Hyland, there are things that must be kept hidden from the public.</b>

16:20.080 --> 16:22.370
<b>Like these deaths.</b>

16:24.920 --> 16:27.170
<b>Does Alisha know about this?</b>

16:31.220 --> 16:32.760
<b>I see.</b>

16:32.760 --> 16:36.010
<b>So you wanted me to see this.</b>

16:36.430 --> 16:42.520
<b>What the Shepherd must quell is the source of all malevolence, the being who gives rise to the hellions:</b>

16:42.980 --> 16:44.940
<b>The Lord of Calamity.</b>

16:45.810 --> 16:47.940
<b>The Lord of Calamity?</b>

16:48.360 --> 16:51.240
<b>He begets hellions with the overwhelming malevolence he possesses.</b>

16:51.240 --> 16:55.610
<b>Given enough time, the Lord of Calamity can even permanently alter the world itself.</b>

16:55.610 --> 16:58.990
<b>Such is the calamity he brings.</b>

17:00.490 --> 17:05.290
<b>So it's the duty of the Shepherd to find and put a stop to him.</b>

17:05.870 --> 17:08.710
<b>You still have so much to learn.</b>

17:08.710 --> 17:14.550
<b>If you face the Lord of Calamity as you are now, you will be overwhelmed by his domain.</b>

17:14.840 --> 17:19.180
<b>The answers you seek are those you must discover for yourself, Sorey.</b>

17:19.180 --> 17:22.020
<b>Answers of your own that you will not regret.</b>

17:22.890 --> 17:24.890
<b>Answers of my own?</b>

17:25.100 --> 17:27.100
<b>Forget not your duty, but be not a slave to it either.</b>

17:27.100 --> 17:30.020
<b>I want you to travel the world and discover all sorts of things.</b>

17:30.070 --> 17:33.690
<b>Only then can you take the answers you have found for yourself</b>

17:33.690 --> 17:37.200
<b>and make a stand against the Lord of Calamity.</b>

17:40.370 --> 17:43.290
<b>It's not that tricky a concept.</b>

17:44.120 --> 17:46.830
<b>Basically, let's take a trip around the world.</b>

17:48.710 --> 17:50.710
<b>Sorey, water!</b>

17:50.710 --> 17:52.460
<b>Water? But how?</b>

17:54.260 --> 18:00.010
<b>Oh, no... How can the malevolence have seeped into the earth beneath Ladylake?</b>

18:00.010 --> 18:02.140
<b>Sorey, we can't stay here!</b>

18:10.690 --> 18:12.150
<b>Oh, crap! The ceiling!</b>

18:16.740 --> 18:17.740
<b>Now!</b>

18:28.080 --> 18:30.130
<b>The land itself is screaming!</b>

18:30.540 --> 18:34.090
<b>It's screaming in pain from the malevolence!</b>

18:34.090 --> 18:35.340
<b>Let's just get out of here!</b>

18:56.740 --> 18:58.740
<b>Thanks, you guys!</b>

18:58.740 --> 18:59.950
<b>Keep moving!</b>

19:06.830 --> 19:09.960
<b>Lailah, is the malevolence causing this too?</b>

19:09.960 --> 19:11.000
<b>Yes!</b>

19:11.000 --> 19:14.710
<b>But this isn't any ordinary malevolence!</b>

19:14.710 --> 19:16.250
<b>Sorey, look!</b>

19:25.100 --> 19:29.430
<b>I see you're resolute even in your inflexibility.</b>

19:29.430 --> 19:31.020
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

19:31.650 --> 19:34.060
<b>You don't have to apologize.</b>

19:34.060 --> 19:38.860
<b>Your integrity is what will guide Ladylake in the right direction.</b>

19:38.860 --> 19:40.820
<b>That's what I believe.</b>

19:41.240 --> 19:46.830
<b>Having said that, Bartlow's goal isn't just to capture the Shepherd.</b>

19:47.370 --> 19:52.830
<b>Yes, his true goal is to remove me from the monarchy.</b>

19:53.290 --> 19:56.090
<b>If you're aware, then there's nothing more for me to say.</b>

19:56.090 --> 19:59.800
<b>But Bartlow has something up his sleeve.</b>

19:59.800 --> 20:01.720
<b>You mean the situation in Marlind?</b>

20:01.720 --> 20:04.680
<b>I'm still more than willing to handle it.</b>

20:06.720 --> 20:10.020
<b>Yes, it's true Marlind is suffering from a plague.</b>

20:11.230 --> 20:17.480
<b>If someone must go, I want to do whatever I can.</b>

20:19.610 --> 20:22.610
<b>Don't carry the weight of the world on your shoulders.</b>

20:22.610 --> 20:26.490
<b>I'm worried about you.</b>

20:28.540 --> 20:30.120
<b>Lady Maltran...</b>

20:33.250 --> 20:35.540
<b>But these winds are awfully strong.</b>

20:35.540 --> 20:37.630
<b>I hope they don't portend disaster.</b>

20:41.880 --> 20:42.840
<b>Alisha!</b>

20:47.100 --> 20:48.390
<b>It can't be!</b>

